{"id":"gma-fig-006","s":"maths","t":"A11-A12","lv":2,"q":"The graph shows a reciprocal curve $y=\\dfrac{k}{x}$ with point P marked. Use P to find $k$, then work out $y$ when $x=16$.","o":["$0.25$","$128$","$0.5$","$64$"],"a":2,"x":"P is at $(2,4)$. For $y=\\frac{k}{x}$, $k=xy=2\\times4=8$. So $y=\\frac{8}{x}$. When $x=16$, $y=8\\div16=0.5$.","w":["Used the $y$-value of P as $k$, so worked out $4\\div16$.","Found $k=8$ but multiplied by 16 instead of dividing.","","Used $4$ as $k$ and multiplied by 16, instead of finding $k=8$ and dividing."],"fig":{"type":"graph","x":[-8,8],"y":[-8,8],"xstep":2,"ystep":2,"xlabel":"x","ylabel":"y","lines":[{"pts":[[-8.0,-1.0],[-7.9,-1.012658],[-7.8,-1.025641],[-7.7,-1.038961],[-7.6,-1.052632],[-7.5,-1.066667],[-7.4,-1.081081],[-7.3,-1.09589],[-7.2,-1.111111],[-7.1,-1.126761],[-7.0,-1.142857],[-6.9,-1.15942],[-6.8,-1.176471],[-6.7,-1.19403],[-6.6,-1.212121],[-6.5,-1.230769],[-6.4,-1.25],[-6.3,-1.269841],[-6.2,-1.290323],[-6.1,-1.311475],[-6.0,-1.333333],[-5.9,-1.355932],[-5.8,-1.37931],[-5.7,-1.403509],[-5.6,-1.428571],[-5.5,-1.454545],[-5.4,-1.481481],[-5.3,-1.509434],[-5.2,-1.538462],[-5.1,-1.568627],[-5.0,-1.6],[-4.9,-1.632653],[-4.8,-1.666667],[-4.7,-1.702128],[-4.6,-1.73913],[-4.5,-1.777778],[-4.4,-1.818182],[-4.3,-1.860465],[-4.2,-1.904762],[-4.1,-1.95122],[-4.0,-2.0],[-3.9,-2.051282],[-3.8,-2.105263],[-3.7,-2.162162],[-3.6,-2.222222],[-3.5,-2.285714],[-3.4,-2.352941],[-3.3,-2.424242],[-3.2,-2.5],[-3.1,-2.580645],[-3.0,-2.666667],[-2.9,-2.758621],[-2.8,-2.857143],[-2.7,-2.962963],[-2.6,-3.076923],[-2.5,-3.2],[-2.4,-3.333333],[-2.3,-3.478261],[-2.2,-3.636364],[-2.1,-3.809524],[-2.0,-4.0],[-1.9,-4.210526],[-1.8,-4.444444],[-1.7,-4.705882],[-1.6,-5.0],[-1.5,-5.333333],[-1.4,-5.714286],[-1.3,-6.153846],[-1.2,-6.666667],[-1.1,-7.272727],[-1.0,-8.0],[-0.9,-8.888889],[-0.8,-10.0],[-0.7,-11.428571],[-0.6,-13.333333],[-0.5,-16.0],[-0.4,-20.0],[-0.3,-26.666667],[-0.2,-40.0],[-0.1,-80.0]],"c":0},{"pts":[[0.1,80.0],[0.2,40.0],[0.3,26.666667