{"id":"gma-fig-001","s":"maths","t":"A8-A10","lv":1,"q":"Points A and B are marked on the straight line on the graph. What is the gradient of the line?","o":["$2$","$-2$","$-\\frac{1}{2}$","$3$"],"a":1,"x":"Read A and B from the graph. Going from A to B, $x$ goes up by 2 and $y$ goes down by 4. Gradient $=\\frac{-4}{2}=-2$. The line slopes down, so the gradient is negative.","w":["Dropped the minus sign. The line goes down as $x$ increases, so the gradient is negative.","","Divided change in $x$ by change in $y$. The gradient is change in $y$ over change in $x$.","Read the $x$-intercept as the gradient. The intercept is not the gradient."],"fig":{"type":"graph","x":[-2,6],"y":[-4,8],"xstep":1,"ystep":2,"xlabel":"x","ylabel":"y","lines":[{"pts":[[-1,8],[4,-2]],"c":0}],"points":[{"at":[1,4],"label":"A"},{"at":[3,0],"label":"B"}],"xnums":true,"ynums":true}}
{"id":"gma-fig-002","s":"maths","t":"A8-A10","lv":2,"q":"The graph shows a straight line. Use the $y$-intercept and one other point where the line passes through a gridline crossing to find its equation.","o":["$y=2x-3$","$y=\\frac{1}{2}x+3$","$y=\\frac{1}{2}x-6$","$y=\\frac{1}{2}x-3$"],"a":3,"x":"The line crosses the $y$-axis at $-3$, so $c=-3$. It also passes through $(6,0)$. From $(0,-3)$ the rise is 3 and the run is 6, so the gradient is $\\frac{1}{2}$. The equation is $y=\\frac{1}{2}x-3$.","w":["Turned the gradient upside down, using run over rise. Rise is 3 and run is 6.","Got the sign of the $y$-intercept wrong. The line crosses the $y$-axis below the origin.","Used the $x$-intercept, 6, to find $c$. The number $c$ is where the line crosses the $y$-axis.",""],"fig":{"type":"graph","x":[-2,8],"y":[-4,4],"xstep":2,"ystep":1,"xlabel":"x","ylabel":"y","lines":[{"pts":[[-2,-4],[8,1]],"c":0}],"xnums":true,"ynums":true}}
{"id":"gma-fig-003","s":"maths","t":"A8-A10","lv":3,"q":"The graph shows line A and point P. Line B is perpendicular to line A and passes through P. What is the equation of line B?","o":["$y=\\frac{1}{2}x+1$","$y=-\\frac{1}{2}x+3$","$y=\\frac{1}{2}x+4$","$y=2x-2$"],"a":0,"x":"Line A passes through $(0,4)$ and $(2,0)$, so its gradient is $-2$. A perpendicular gradient is $\\frac{1}{2}$. Line B goes through $P(2,2)$: $2=1+c$, so $c=1$. The equation is $y=\\frac{1}{2}x+1$.","w":["","Flipped the gradient but kept the minus sign. A perpendicular gradient needs the sign changed too.","Used the $y$-intercept of line A as $c$. Line B must pass through P.","Changed the sign but did not flip. A gradient of 2 is not perpendicular to $-2$."],"fig":{"type":"graph","x":[-2,6],"y":[-4,8],"xstep":1,"ystep":2,"xlabel":"x","ylabel":"y","lines":[{"pts":[[-1,6],[4,-4]],"label":"A","c":0}],"points":[{"at":[2,2],"label":"P"}],"xnums":true,"ynums":true}}
{"id":"gma-fig-015","s":"maths","t":"A11-A12","lv":2,"q":"The graph shows a quadratic curve. Points P and Q are where it crosses the $x$-axis. Use the graph to find the equation of the line of symmetry of the curve.","o":["$x=2$","$x=3$","$x=-4$","$y=3$"],"a":1,"x":"P is at $x=1$ and Q is at $x=5$. The line of symmetry is halfway between them: $(1+5)\\div2=3$. It is a vertical line, so its equation is $x=3$. The turning point is also at $x=3$.","w":["Took half the distance between P and Q, which is 2, and forgot to add on the starting value of 1.","","Read the $y$-value of the minimum point and used it as an $x$-value.","Found the right number but wrote a horizontal line. A line of symmetry through a minimum is vertical, $x=$ a number."],"fig":{"type":"graph","x":[0,6],"y":[-6,6],"xstep":1,"ystep":2,"xlabel":"x","ylabel":"y","lines":[{"pts":[[0.0,5.0],[0.0375,4.776406],[0.075,4.555625],[0.1125,4.337656],[0.15,4.1225],[0.1875,3.910156],[0.225,3.700625],[0.2625,3.493906],[0.3,3.29],[0.3375,3.088906],[0.375,2.890625],[0.4125,2.695156],[0.45,2.5025],[0.4875,2.312656],[0.525,2.125625],[0.5625,1.941406],[0.6,1.76],[0.6375,1.581406],[0.675,1.405625],[0.7125,1.232656],[0.75,1.0625],[0.7875,0.895156],[0.825,0.730625],[0.8625,0.568906],[0.9,0.41],[0.9375,0.253906],[0.975,0.100625],[1.0125,-0.049844],[1.05,-0.1975],[1.0875,-0.342344],[1.125,-0.484375],[1.1625,-0.623594],[1.2,-0.76],[1.2375,-0.893594],[1.275,-1.024375],[1.3125,-1.152344],[1.35,-1.2775],[1.3875,-1.399844],[1.425,-1.519375],[1.4625,-1.636094],[1.5,-1.75],[1.5375,-1.861094],[1.575,-1.969375],[1.6125,-2.074844],[1.65,-2.1775],[1.6875,-2.277344],[1.725,-2.374375],[1.7625,-2.468594],[1.8,-2.56],[1.8375,-2.648594],[1.875,-2.734375],[1.9125,-2.817344],[1.95,-2.8975],[1.9875,-2.974844],[2.025,-3.049375],[2.0625,-3.121094],[2.1,-3.19],[2.1375,-3.256094],[2.175,-3.319375],[2.2125,-3.379844],[2.25,-3.4375],[2.2875,-3.492344],[2.325,-3.544375],[2.3625,-3.593594],[2.4,-3.64],[2.4375,-3.683594],[2.475,-3.724375],[2.5125,-3.76