{"id":"gma-fig-017","s":"maths","t":"A11-A12","lv":3,"q":"The graph shows an exponential curve $y=k\\times a^x$ with points P and Q marked. Use the graph to find the values of $k$ and $a$.","o":["$k=3,\\ a=2$","$k=3,\\ a=4$","$k=2,\\ a=3$","$k=3,\\ a=6$"],"a":0,"x":"P is on the $y$-axis at $(0,3)$, so $k\\times a^0=k=3$. Q is at $(2,12)$, so $3a^2=12$. Then $a^2=4$ and $a=2$.","w":["","Found $a^2=4$ but forgot to take the square root, so gave $a^2$ as $a$.","Swapped the two values, putting the $y$-intercept in for $a$ and the growth factor in for $k$.","Divided the $y$-value of Q by its $x$-value, $12\\div2$, and ignored $k$ and the power."],"fig":{"type":"graph","x":[-1,3],"y":[0,24],"xstep":1,"ystep":3,"xlabel":"x","ylabel":"y","lines":[{"pts":[[-1.0,1.5],[-0.975,1.52622],[-0.95,1.552897],[-0.925,1.580042],[-0.9,1.60766],[-0.875,1.635762],[-0.85,1.664354],[-0.825,1.693447],[-0.8,1.723048],[-0.775,1.753166],[-0.75,1.783811],[-0.725,1.814991],[-0.7,1.846717],[-0.675,1.878997],[-0.65,1.911841],[-0.625,1.945259],[-0.6,1.979262],[-0.575,2.013859],[-0.55,2.04906],[-0.525,2.084877],[-0.5,2.12132],[-0.475,2.1584],[-0.45,2.196129],[-0.425,2.234516],[-0.4,2.273575],[-0.375,2.313316],[-0.35,2.353752],[-0.325,2.394895],[-0.3,2.436757],[-0.275,2.479351],[-0.25,2.522689],[-0.225,2.566785],[-0.2,2.611652],[-0.175,2.657303],[-0.15,2.703751],[-0.125,2.751012],[-0.1,2.799099],[-0.075,2.848026],[-0.05,2.897809],[-0.025,2.948462],[0.0,3.0],[0.025,3.052439],[0.05,3.105795],[0.075,3.160083],[0.1,3.21532],[0.125,3.271523],[0.15,3.328708],[0.175,3.386893],[0.2,3.446095],[0.225,3.506332],[0.25,3.567621],[0.275,3.629982],[0.3,3.693433],[0.325,3.757993],[0.35,3.823682],[0.375,3.890519],[0.4,3.958524],[0.425,4.027718],[0.45,4.098121],[0.475,4.169755],[0.5,4.242641],[0.525,4.316801],[0.55,4.392257],[0.575,4.469032],[0.6,4.54715],[0.625,4.626632],[0.65,4.707505],[0.675,4.78979],[0.7,4.873514],[0.725,4.958702],[0.75,5.045378],[0.775,5.13357],[0.8,5.223303],[0.825,5.314605],[0.85,5.407503],[0.87