{"id":"gma-fig-012","s":"maths","t":"A8-A10","lv":2,"q":"The graph shows the cost of hiring a bike for different numbers of hours. What is the fixed charge, and what is the cost for each extra hour?","o":["Fixed charge £5, then £10 per hour","Fixed charge £10, then £5 per hour","Fixed charge £10, then £15 per hour","Fixed charge £10, then £40 per hour"],"a":1,"x":"The line meets the cost axis at £10, so the fixed charge is £10. From 0 to 2 hours the cost goes from £10 to £20. That is £10 for 2 hours, so the gradient is £5 per hour.","w":["You swapped the two jobs. The intercept is the fixed charge and the gradient is the cost per hour.","","You read the total cost at 1 hour as the hourly rate. That total still includes the fixed charge.","You read the cost at the end of the line, for 6 hours, as the cost for one hour."],"fig":{"type":"graph","x":[0,6],"y":[0,40],"xstep":1,"ystep":5,"xlabel":"time / hours","ylabel":"cost / £","lines":[{"pts":[[0,10],[6,40]],"c":0}],"xnums":true,"ynums":true}}
{"id":"gma-fig-013","s":"maths","t":"A8-A10","lv":1,"q":"Lines A and B are the graphs of two simultaneous equations. Use the graph to solve the equations. Which pair of values is the solution?","o":["$x=3$, $y=2$","$x=0$, $y=5$","$x=2$, $y=3$","$x=1$, $y=1$"],"a":2,"x":"The solution of two simultaneous equations is where their lines cross. The lines cross at $(2,3)$. So $x=2$ and $y=3$.","w":["You gave the coordinates the wrong way round. A point is written $(x,y)$, with $x$ first.","You read where line B meets the $y$-axis. That is not on line A.","","You read the point where line A starts. It is not on line B."],"fig":{"type":"graph","x":[0,5],"y":[0,8],"xstep":1,"ystep":1,"xlabel":"x","ylabel":"y","lines":[{"pts":[[1,1],[4,7]],"label":"A","c":0},{"pts":[[0,5],[5,0]],"label":"B","c":1}],"xnums":true,"ynums":true}}
{"id":"gma-fig-014","s":"maths","t":"A8-A10","lv":2,"q":"Line L is shown on the graph with point P. A second line is parallel to L and passes through P. What is the equation of the second line?","o":["$y=-\\frac{1}{2}x+4$","$y=\\frac{1}{2}x+3$","$y=-2x+13$","$y=-\\frac{1}{2}x+7$"],"a":3,"x":"L goes from $(0,4)$ to $(8,0)$, so its gradient is $-\\frac{4}{8}=-\\frac12$. Parallel lines have the same gradient. P is $(4,5)$, so $5=-2+c$ and $c=7$.","w":["You used the $y$-intercept of L. That is the same line as L, and it does not pass through P.","You lost the minus sign on the gradient. L slopes down, so its gradient is negative.","You turned the gradient upside down and used $-2$. Gradient is change in $y$ over change in $x$.",""],"fig":{"type":"graph","x":[0,8],"y":[0,8],"xstep":1,"ystep":1,"xlabel":"x","ylabel":"y","lines":[{"pts":[[0,4],[8,0]],"label":"L","c":0}],"points":[{"at":[4,5],"label":"P"}],"xnums":true,"ynums":true}}
{"id":"gma-fig-041","s":"maths","t":"R16","lv":2,"q":"The graph shows the number of bacteria in a dish. Points A, B and C are marked on it. Use the graph to find the percentage increase in the number of bacteria each hour.","o":["50%","100%","200%","300%"],"a":1,"x":"At 0 hours there are 100 bacteria and at 1 hour there are 200. The number is multiplied by 2 each hour. That is an increase of 100%. From 1 to 2 hours it doubles again.","w":["Compared the wrong way round: 100 is 50% of 200, but this is the fraction of the new value, not the increase.","","Used the multiplier 2 as the percentage increase. The multiplier is 200% of the old amount, but the increase is 100%.","Compared 100 with 400, which is two hours. That is an increase of 300% over two hours, not one."],"fig":{"type":"graph","x":[0,3],"y":[0,800],"xstep":0.5,"ystep":100,"xlabel":"time / hours","ylabel":"number of bacteria","lines":[{"pts":[[0.0,100.0],[0.01875,101.308133],[0.0375,102.633378],[0.05625,103.97596],[0.075,105.336104],[0.09375,106.71404],[0.1125,108.110002],[0.13125,109.524225],[0.15,110.956947],[0.16875,112.408412],[0.1875,113.878863],[0.20625,115.368551],[0.225,116.877725],[0.24375,118.406641],[0.2625,119.955558],[0.28125,121.524736],[0.3,123.114441],[0.31875,124.724942],[0.3375,126.35651],[0.35625,128.009422],[0.375,129.683955],[0.39375,131.380394],[0.4125,133.099025],[0.43125,134.840137],[0.45,136.604026],[0.46875,138.390988],[0.4875,140.201327],[0.50625,142.035347],[0.525,143.893358],[0.54375,145.775675],[0.5625,147.682615],[0.58125,149.6145],[0.6,151.571657],[0.61875,153.554416],[0.6375,155.563112],[0.65625,157.598085],[0.675,159.659677],[0.69375,161.748238],[0.7125,163.864121],[0.73125,166.007682],[0.75,168.179283],[0.76875,170.379292],[0.7875,172.60808],[0.80625,174.866023],[0.825,177.153504],[0.84375,179.470908],[0.8625,181.818626],[0.88125,184.197056],[0.9,186.606598],[0.91875,189.047661],[0.9375,191.520656],[0.95625,194.026001],[0.975,196.56412],[0.99375,199.13544],[1.0125,201.740