{"id":"gma-fig-042","s":"maths","t":"R16","lv":3,"q":"The graph shows the mass of a radioactive sample every 10 minutes. It decays by the same fraction each time. Use it to work out the mass left after 60 minutes.","o":["1.25 g","10 g","5 g","2.5 g"],"a":3,"x":"The bars read 160, 80, 40, 20, so the mass halves every 10 minutes. After 30 minutes it is 20 g. Then 40 min: 10 g, 50 min: 5 g, 60 min: 2.5 g.","w":["Halved four times after 30 minutes, which gives the mass at 70 minutes, not 60.","Halved only once after 30 minutes, which gives the mass at 40 minutes.","Halved only twice after 30 minutes, which gives the mass at 50 minutes.",""],"fig":{"type":"bar","cats":["0","10","20","30"],"vals":[160,80,40,20],"y":[0,160],"ystep":20,"xlabel":"time / minutes","ylabel":"mass / g"}}
{"id":"gma-fig-043","s":"maths","t":"R16","lv":3,"q":"The graph shows the number of followers of two pages, A and B. After how many months does page A move ahead of page B and stay ahead?","o":["After 2 months","After 1 month","After 3 months","From the start"],"a":0,"x":"The lines meet at 1 month and again at 2 months. Between them the straight line B is higher. After 2 months the curve A is above B and keeps rising faster.","w":["","Took the first meeting point. After it, B is ahead again until the lines meet a second time.","Read the last gridline, where A is clearly ahead. A actually passes B earlier, at the second meeting point.","Saw that A starts higher. But B overtakes A between 1 and 2 months, so A is not ahead for good."],"fig":{"type":"graph","x":[0,3],"y":[0,800],"xstep":0.5,"ystep":100,"xlabel":"time / months","ylabel":"followers","lines":[{"pts":[[0.0,100.0],[0.01875,101.308133],[0.0375,102.633378],[0.05625,103.97596],[0.075,105.336104],[0.09375,106.71404],[0.1125,108.110002],[0.13125,109.524225],[0.15,110.956947],[0.16875,112.408412],[0.1875,113.878863],[0.20625,115.368551],[0.225,116.877725],[0.24375,118.406641],[0.2625,119.955558],[0.28125,121.524736],[0.3,123.114441],[0.31875,124.724942],[0.3375,126.35651],[0.35625,128.009422],[0.375,129.683955],[0.39375,131.380394],[0.4125,133.099025],[0.43125,134.840137],[0.45,136.604026],[0.46875,138.390988],[0.4875,140.201327],[0.50625,142.035347],[0.525,143.893358],[0.54375,145.775675],[0.5625,147.682615],[0.58125,149.6145],[0.6,151.571657],[0.61875,153.554416],[0.6375,155.563112],[0.65625,157.598085],[0.675,159.659677],[0.69375,161.748238],[0.7125,163.864121],[0.73125,166.007682],[0.75,168.179283],[0.76875,170.379292],[0.7875,172.60808],[0.80625,174.866023],[0.825,177.153504],[0.84375,179.470908],[0.8625,181.818626],[0.88125,184.197056],[0.9,186.606598],[0.91875,189.047661],[0.9375,191.520656],[0.95625,194.026001],[0.975,196.56412],[0.99375,199.13544],[1.0125,201.740397],[1.03125,204.37943],[1.05,207.052985],