{"id":"gma-fig-026","s":"maths","t":"A17-A18","lv":2,"q":"The graph shows lines A and B. Line A is $y=2x-3$. Which option gives an equation for where the lines cross, with its correct solution?","o":["$2x-3=6-x$, so $x=3$","$2x-3=x+6$, so $x=9$","$2x-3=-x-6$, so $x=-1$","$2x-3=6-x$, so $x=1$"],"a":0,"x":"Line B starts at 6 on the y-axis and goes down 1 for each 1 across, so $y=6-x$. Set equal: $2x-3=6-x$. Then $3x=9$, so $x=3$.","w":["","Read line B as sloping up, so used gradient $+1$. Line B slopes down, so its gradient is $-1$.","Took the intercept of line B as $-6$. The graph shows it crosses the y-axis at $+6$.","Right equation, but then worked out $3x=3$. Adding 3 to both sides gives $3x=9$, not $3x=3$."],"fig":{"type":"graph","x":[0,6],"y":[-4,8],"xstep":1,"ystep":2,"xlabel":"x","ylabel":"y","lines":[{"pts":[[0,-3],[5,7]],"label":"A","c":0},{"pts":[[0,6],[6,0]],"label":"B","c":1}],"points":[{"at":[3,3],"label":"P"}],"xnums":true,"ynums":true}}
{"id":"gma-fig-027","s":"maths","t":"A17-A18","lv":3,"q":"The graph shows the curve $y=x^2+bx+c$ with its turning point marked T. Which option is the equation of the curve written in the form $y=(x-p)^2+q$?","o":["$y=(x+3)^2-4$","$y=(x-3)^2+4$","$y=(x-3)^2-4$","$y=(x-4)^2-3$"],"a":2,"x":"The turning point of $y=(x-p)^2+q$ is $(p,q)$. From the graph T is $(3,-4)$. So $y=(x-3)^2-4$, which expands to $x^2-6x+5$.","w":["Used $(x+p)$ with $p=3$. The bracket is $(x-p)$, so a turning point at $x=3$ gives $(x-3)$.","Gave the y-coordinate of T as $+4$. T is below the x-axis, so $q=-4$.","","Swapped the coordinates of T, putting $-4$ in the bracket and $3$ outside. The x-value goes in the bracket."],"fig":{"type":"graph","x":[0,6],"y":[-6,6],"xstep":1,"ystep":2,"xlabel":"x","ylabel":"y","lines":[{"pts":[[0.0,5.0],[0.0375,4.776406],[0.075,4.555625],[0.1125,4.337656],[0.15,4.1225],[0.1875,3.910156],[0.225,3.700625],[0.2625,3.493906],[0.3,3.29],[0.3375,3.088906],[0.375,2.890625],[0.4125,2.695156],[0.45,2.5025],[0.4875,2.312656],[0.525,2.125625],[0.5625,1.941406],[0.6,1.76],[0.6375,1.581406],[0.675,1.405625],[0.7125,1.232656],[0.75,1.0625],[0.7875,0.895156],[0.825,0.730625],[0.8625,0.568906],[0.9,0.41],[0.9375,0.253906],[0.975,0.100625],[1.0125,-0.049844],[1.05,-0.1975],[1.0875,-0.342344],[1.125,-0.484375],[1.1625,-0.623594],[1.2,-0.76],[1.2375,-0.893594],[1.275,-1.024375],[1.3125,-1.152344],[1.35,-1.2775],[1.3875,-1.399844],[1.425,-1.519375],[1.4625,-1.636094],[1.5,-1.75],[1.5375,-1.861094],[1.575,-1.969375],[1.6125,-2.074844],[1.65,-2.1775],[1.6875,-2.277344],[1.725,-2.374375],[1.7625,-2.468594],[1.8,-2.56],[1.8375,-2.648594],[1.875,-2.734375],[1.9125,-2.817344],[1.95,-2.8975],[1.9875,-2.974844],[2.025,-3.049375],[2.0625,-3.121094],[2.1,-3.19],[2.1375,-3.256094],[2.175,-3.319375],[2.2125,-3.379844],[2.25,-3.4375],[2.2875,-3.492344],[2.325,-3.544375],[2.3625,-3.593594],[2.4,-3.64],[2.4375,-3.683594],[2.475,-3.724375],[2.5125,-3.762344],[2.55,-3.7975],[2.5875,-3.829844],[2.625,-3